{"id":"01a0f490-2f25-7684-9157-17e5bc6816e3","slug":"harvard-undergraduate-plant-based","name":"Harvard Undergraduate Plant Based","acronym":null,"shortDescription":"Student-led group promoting plant-based diets through campus events, food outings, and efforts to change dining hall food practices.","orgType":null,"recognitionStatus":"recognized","activityStatus":"active","joinModes":["application","comp"],"freshmenEligible":null,"joining":{"comp":true,"dues":false,"roles":[],"access":"process","noCuts":false,"general":["application","comp"],"conflicts":[],"firstYears":null,"noExperience":null},"categories":[{"slug":"hobbies-games","name":"Hobbies & Games"}],"memberCount":null,"instagramFollowers":null,"hoursPerWeek":null,"currentCycle":null,"isFixture":false,"completeness":0.6,"sourceCount":6,"lastObservedAt":"2026-09-30T23:18:18.544Z","lastVerifiedAt":"2026-09-30T23:18:18.544Z","eligibleClasses":null,"affiliationScope":"harvard_college","activityConfidence":0.8,"activityReasons":["listed on a current official directory","own website mentions 2025"],"quickLinks":{"website":"https://www.hupb.org/","instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/hu.plant.based"},"logo":null,"pressCount":0,"longDescription":"In the fall of 2021, our founders were connected with the Plant Futures Initiative during a class taught by Professor Saha, EXPOS 20—Animals in Politics. Plant Futures Initiative is a social venture committed to accelerating the transition to a plant-centric world for planetary, human and animal well being by equipping and empowering the next generation of food system leaders with the necessary education, experience and network to become change makers. Upon speaking with the founder of PFI, we decided to start a chapter at Harvard, becoming one of the first chapters of the organization. We hosted a Launch Event at Professor Bazerman’s house in the Spring of 2022 and began our official journey as a club during the Fall of 2022. During our inaugural year, we formed a board of 11 students and 9 faculty advisors and hosted numerous collaborative events with other clubs and organizations. In the Fall of 2023, we officially rebranded as Harvard Undergraduate Plant Based. This academic year, we’re continuing to partner with organizations to expand opportunities for students, improve access to plant-based options, and raise awareness about the impacts of our food choices.","joiningBasis":{"comp":{"rule":"stated_comp","claimIds":["01a0f49c-b931-7e6a-88fb-9ceac18666b9"],"sources":[{"url":"https://hupb.org/fall-2025-info","title":"Fall 2025 Info | Harvard Plant Based","sourceType":"club_website","observedAt":"2026-09-30T23:18:15.772Z","isFixture":false}]},"dues":{"rule":"stated_dues","claimIds":["01a0f490-2f29-7183-aad8-b712a737f418"],"sources":[{"url":"https://soco.college.harvard.edu/club_signup","title":"Student organization directory","sourceType":"harvard_official","observedAt":"2026-09-30T23:04:40.834Z","isFixture":false}]},"access":{"rule":"stated_process","claimIds":["01a0f49c-b931-7e6a-88fb-9ceac18666b9","01a0f49c-b932-7623-9ce4-cd04cb81b7f9"],"sources":[{"url":"https://hupb.org/fall-2025-info","title":"Fall 2025 Info | Harvard Plant Based","sourceType":"club_website","observedAt":"2026-09-30T23:18:15.772Z","isFixture":false}]}},"aliases":[],"links":[{"kind":"email","url":"mailto:harvardplantfutures@gmail.com","handle":"harvardplantfutures@gmail.com","label":null,"status":"verified","confidence":0,"signals":["linked from the club's official website"],"discoveredVia":["club_website"],"lastObservedAt":"2026-09-30T23:18:15.772Z"},{"kind":"instagram","url":"https://www.instagram.com/hu.plant.based","handle":"hu.plant.based","label":null,"status":"verified","confidence":0,"signals":["linked from the club's official website"],"discoveredVia":["club_website"],"lastObservedAt":"2026-09-30T23:18:15.772Z"},{"kind":"linkedin","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/harvard-undergraduate-plant-based","handle":"harvard-undergraduate-plant-based","la