the necessary education, experience and network to become change makers. Upon speaking with the founder of PFI, we decided to start a chapter at Harvard, becoming one of the first chapters of the organization. We hosted a Launch Event at Professor Bazerman’s house in the Spring of 2022 and began our official journey as a club during the Fall of 2022. During our inaugural year, we formed a board of 11 students and 9 faculty advisors and hosted numerous collaborative events with other clubs and organizations. In the Fall of 2023, we officially rebranded as Harvard Undergraduate Plant Based. This academic year, we’re continuing to partner with organizations to expand opportunities for students, improve access to plant-based options, and raise awareness about the impacts of our food choices.","claimId":"01a0f49c-b91d-76f7-869c-0d3f59bb260e","badge":"verified","confidence":0,"assertionKind":"stated","bestTier":0,"observedAt":"2026-09-30T23:18:09.506Z","asOf":null,"stale":false,"sources":[{"sourceId":"","sourceType":"club_website","url":"https://hupb.org/about","title":"About | Harvard Plant Based","observedAt":"2026-09-30T23:18:09.506Z","isFixture":false,"quote":null}]},"alternatives":[],"conflict":false},"club.affiliation_scope":{"kind":"single","current":{"value":"harvard_college","claimId":"01a0f490-2f29-74aa-ac37-1368493cb37c","badge":"verified","confidence":0,"assertionKind":"stated","bestTier":0,"observedAt":"2026-09-30T23:04:40.834Z","asOf":null,"stale":false,"sources":[{"sourceId":"","sourceType":"harvard_official","url":"https://soco.college.harvard.edu/club_signup","title":"Student organization directory","observedAt":"2026-09-30T23:04:40.834Z","isFixture":false,"quote":null}]},"alternatives":[],"conflict":false},"club.short_description":{"kind":"single","current":{"value":"An undergraduate plant-based advocacy group at Harvard.","claimId":"01a0f49c-b930-74e4-a8f5-dd8c74f8b538","badge":"verified","confidence":0,"assertionKind":"stated","bestTier":0,"observedAt"